&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who has the identity provider just created, changed or deleted?&lt;/strong&gt;
An identity provider (Entra ID, Okta, Keycloak, …) creates, updates and deletes
people and groups in your application over HTTP; this package is that HTTP
endpoint, for Users and Groups (RFC 7643, RFC 7644), over a &lt;code&gt;Backend&lt;/code&gt; you
write. Pure Go, &lt;code&gt;CGO_ENABLED=0&lt;/code&gt;, standard library only.&lt;/p&gt;
